body=f'''# Major step029 - expired owner window and final closeout

Recorded {stamp}. The authorized local/private window ended **2026-10-02T22:36:15Z**. No extension was supplied. This step performs final readback, restoration and documentation only. Further implementation, binding, QA, release, native or scientific work requires a fresh owner interval and the existing guards.

The project is **unfinished**. Root has not applied the staged successor, completed fresh canonical QA/release, or accepted native recovery. The controller remains at D177 commit3f74b1d248e003168157e207e28ca775364f1f26 with two tracked D178 changes. The [current read-only Git observation](root-owner-window-closeout001/ROOT_CLOSEOUT_CONTROLLER_GIT_001.json),cca472cb, records exactly the controller and recovery-test modifications. The [finite readback](root-owner-window-closeout001/ROOT_CLOSEOUT_FINITE_OBSERVATION_001.json),ebb9024c, checks101 selected paths in three passes and preserves32 independent byte copies. Both live source/test hashes remain5aee7479/3ed35399. Only SESSION differs from its11:55 predecessor. The same single g9-governance-001 accepted receipt is present; fixed continuation002 helper/start/terminal and final verification paths remain absent in this finite selection. Historical Gate009 acceptance remains one13-node governance partition, with44 partitions/5562 nodes unaccepted and two failed heavy attempts. This is not a new full742/263 audit, result acceptance, global helper absence or cause finding.

Read-only Git setup first refused the PATH binary (958ff1), then the frozen binary refused the current OS-user ownership (2872d5). Root selected the pinned frozen Git and used a repository-specific command-line safe.directory for the two read-only commands (5fcec5); no global Git configuration changed. These setup refusals are separate from QA results or frozen-runtime drift.

The [Doc28 different review](INDEPENDENT_DOCS_REFRESH_REVIEW_028.json),fb25b9c7, passed frozen creation scope:35 declarations/22 pairs/18 links. The [Metadata002 different closeout review](metadata002-actual-freshness-closeout001/INDEPENDENT_ACTUAL_METADATA002_CLOSEOUT_REVIEW_001.json),13327bc8, passed metadata closeout only:10 pairs/17 timed absences. It independently reconstructs capture-core publication age74.991934 seconds and Root closeout age728.190852. Actual authorization/capture accepted current742+55 configurations+four runtime files, zero whole trees. No unit was entered. Metadata002 remains permanently withdrawn; preserve its spent writer/helper/parent and all bytes. No replay, retimestamp, TTL extension or reuse for future GO. GG5 copied14 driver/whole observer remain unentered/unspent, without actual acceptance. Bound/late utility and packet-composer mains were never entered in this workflow.

The [publication/native package](raw004-publication-native-bounded-closure-prep001/HANDOFF.md) is now frozen author preparation, manifestdd016b7d, with35 sources,1139 payload/1140 manifest-inclusive files and912 declared original/copy pairs. The author reports common910e70e7 at183844 bytes, growth5258, source headroom473, canonical frame261514 and frame headroom628. All128 native and29 metadata named methods, including421 declared native subtest events, remain **UNRUN**. These are authored static facts, not independent complete-source acceptance or runtime results. All16 selected paths, eight full OS commands, finite actual acquisition bounds/parity, runtime/physical capture and Job proof remain unbound. The different complete-source audit did not run after the requested review agent returned a model-capacity error. Static guards, two compiled historical middles and all31 typed policy facts still need that review and real healthy/negative/restored controls. Do not bind or apply this package based on this handoff.

[Choice010](ROOT_CONSUMER005_CAPSULE_SOURCE_CHOICE_010.json),2b67f310, authorized a compact source capsule and precision supplement only. The [frozen capsule handoff](consumer005-compact-source-capsule-prep001/HANDOFF_001.md) records capsule4c81e41d,24627 bytes under131072,18 closed top-level fields,41 selected original/copy pairs and88 finite inputs. The first own metadata writer created four JSON files/copies and failed while writing ASCII Markdown; distinct completion002 preserved those bytes and completed metadata. Its initial prewrite timestamps/raw9 witness did not persist and are not retroactively claimed. A different capsule derivation peer remains pending. No reader, harness, event grammar, binding or runtime was approved. Existing Consumer005 full source peer5a283 remains source/causal preparation only; all24 sibling-class methods are unrun. Preserve the exact old51 top-level/nested12 versus new38-field/2553985-byte distinction and456833-byte2MiB overrun.

The [fresh pipeline design001 peer](guard006-metadata3-pipeline-design-independent-audit001/INDEPENDENT_FRESH_METADATA_PIPELINE_DESIGN_REVIEW_001.json),56e268dd, refused explicit ordering and role precision. The author froze [corrected design002](guard005-fresh-metadata-pipeline-design001/HANDOFF_002.md),3590467c/manifest1147cddf. It orders ACK22, independent BOUND22, Root three-literal launcher binding, independent LATE14 and separate Root GO; it corrects two historical fixed filenames and preserves seven Git metadata roles separately from four runtime files. Design002 awaits a different narrow peer and Root namespace/implementation choice. FreshGG6+M3 is a preference, not authorization. No new source implementation, actual binding, checker process, metadata timer or unit action followed. Every before/after parser, genuine producer and independently owned decision checker must be prepared and reviewed before a future capture. Both original context/runtime ages<=90,600 lifetime, resource<=60 and Root450+after60 reserves remain unchanged.

The remaining path to the requested outcome is concrete: complete different reviews of publication/native and capsule; review design002 and select a fresh complete metadata/harness chain; implement and audit all before/after roles and bounded meaningful fixtures; execute fresh isolated Raw58/Consumer24/Metadata29/Native128 and baseline14 checks under actual runtime/resource/provenance guards; integrate the exact25-path successor only after sole-executor coordination; complete fresh full gate, docs/governance, runtime/residue/inspection and clean local release; independently admit that committed release; then enter a distinct reviewed native recovery/seal/downstream chain against the unchanged existing recovery records. This list records outstanding work and grants no permission. Existing14/58/24/24+2/111 preparations and the new128/29 remain unrun; old171-node Raw003-schema2 PASS is preserved historical component evidence only.

Closeout restoration is complete. The [genuine Root host record](root-owner-window-closeout001/ROOT_CLOSEOUT_HOST_OBSERVATION_001.json),f57b01de, records arbop_p2p_monitor Disabled to enabled/Ready at05:41 UTC October3. Root did not manually start it (toolccf7d5). The visible-command-line query found zero workspace references and keeperPID52988 absent. Those observations do not establish complete host visibility, absence of every ceremony, native quiet, a lease or an OS Job. Unrelated processes were untouched. Keeper's consumed launch remains preserved; never replay it.

No child agent remains running at closeout entry. The requested publication/native peer and headroom feasibility turns errored before doing their new tasks; frozen author artifacts remain exact. SourceChoice010, capsule and corrected design are preserved pending review. The sole-executor ACK, resource lease and durable quiet-host agreement remain unresolved. Canonical and Pro3 execution holds remain; no public action or push. Preserve attempt012's spent recovery, incident/terminal twins, the existing epoch, frozen science, all history, original caps/reserves, piped GO and noNonInteractive. This closeout does not turn preparatory work into completed recovery or extend the owner window.
